According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the township has a total area of 94.7 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (36.6 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  94.7 km&amp;sup2; (36.6 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

