== Attractions ==
Catfish Derby Days is an annual three-day city celebration held on the fourth weekend in July. Events include a Fishing Contest, Street Dance, Square Dance, Sunday Parades, Co-Ed Volleyball Tournament, Men's 12 Team Softball Tournament, Queen Contest/Variety Show, Horseshoe Pitching Tournament, Chess Tournament, Flea Market, &quot;Kiss the Catfish Contest&quot;, Music at the Park, Fear Factor - Kid's Style, Raffle, Church Services, and Fire Department Water Fight.

