The median income for a household in the township is $63,906, and the median income for a family is $68,250. Males have a median income of $45,577 versus $27,424 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the township is $23,065.  2.8% of the population and 2.1% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 3.8% of those under the age of 18 and 1.4% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.
