According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the township has a total area of 92.9 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (35.8 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  90.6 km&amp;sup2; (35.0 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 2.3 km&amp;sup2; (0.9 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 2.43% water.

