According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the township has a total area of 100.8 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (38.9 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  97.2 km&amp;sup2; (37.5 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 3.5 km&amp;sup2; (1.4 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 3.52% water.

