      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Melrose Township''' is a township located in [[Stearns County, Minnesota]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the township had a total population of 772.

== Geography ==
According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the township has a total area of 104.4 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (40.3 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  102.7 km&amp;sup2; (39.7 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 1.7 km&amp;sup2; (0.7 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 1.66% water.

