      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Appleton Township''' is a township located in [[Swift County, Minnesota]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the township had a total population of 232.

== Geography ==
According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the township has a total area of 82.5 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (31.9 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  79.8 km&amp;sup2; (30.8 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 2.7 km&amp;sup2; (1.0 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 3.29% water.

