      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Benson Township''' is a township located in [[Swift County, Minnesota]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the township had a total population of 367.

== Geography ==
According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the township has a total area of 93.2 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (36.0 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  88.8 km&amp;sup2; (34.3 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 4.3 km&amp;sup2; (1.7 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 4.64% water.

== Demographics ==
