The median income for a household in the township is $41,406, and the median income for a family is $41,875. Males have a median income of $25,000 versus $18,750 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the township is $15,175.  7.9% of the population and 9.1% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 9.1% of those under the age of 18 and 25.0% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

