The median income for a household in the township is $38,125, and the median income for a family is $39,375. Males have a median income of $39,583 versus $5,833 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the township is $14,443.  22.5% of the population and 18.2% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 22.2% of those under the age of 18 and 33.3% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

