      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Wabasha''' is a city located in [[Wabasha County, Minnesota]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,599.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Wabasha County, Minnesota|Wabasha County]][[Geographic references|&lt;sup&gt;6&lt;/sup&gt;]].

Wabasha was the setting of the movies ''[[Grumpy Old Men]]'' and ''[[Grumpier Old Men]]''.
== Geography ==
[[Image:MNMap-doton-Wabasha.png|right|Location of Wabasha, Minnesota]]
According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 24.1 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (9.3 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  21.1 km&amp;sup2; (8.2 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 2.9 km&amp;sup2; (1.1 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 12.16% water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]][[Geographic references#2|&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;]] of [[2000]], there are 2,599 people, 1,062 households, and 665 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 123.0/km&amp;sup2; (318.4/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 1,166 housing units at an average density of 55.2/km&amp;sup2; (142.9/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 97.96% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.69% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.54% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.15% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.19% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.46% from two or more races.  0.31% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 1,062 households out of which 26.4% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 52.5% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 7.7% have a female householder with no husband present, and 37.3% are non-families. 32.3% of all households are made up of individuals and 15.4% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.27 and the average family size is 2.85.

In the city the population is spread out with 22.0% under the age of 18, 6.3% from 18 to 24, 23.3% from 25 to 44, 25.9% from 45 to 64, and 22.4% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 44 years.  For every 100 females there are 90.0 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 84.2 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $35,291, and the median income for a family is $45,391. Males have a median income of $34,223 versus $24,167 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $20,374.  10.0% of the population and 5.2% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 10.8% of those under the age of 18 and 14.3% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

