According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the township has a total area of 91.1 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (35.2 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  91.1 km&amp;sup2; (35.2 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

