      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Waseca''' is a city located in [[Waseca County, Minnesota]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 8,493.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Waseca County, Minnesota|Waseca County]][[Geographic references|&lt;sup&gt;6&lt;/sup&gt;]].

== Geography ==
