      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Wilton Township''' is a township located in [[Waseca County, Minnesota]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the township had a total population of 392.

== Geography ==
According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the township has a total area of 93.5 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (36.1 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  92.4 km&amp;sup2; (35.7 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 1.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.4 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 1.22% water.

