      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Dellwood''' is a city located in [[Washington County, Minnesota]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,033.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MNMap-doton-Dellwood.png|right|Location of Dellwood, Minnesota]]
According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 7.4 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (2.8 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  7.1 km&amp;sup2; (2.8 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.2 km&amp;sup2; (0.1 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 3.16% water.

----
Notable residents of Dellwood include the late Herb Brooks, coach of the Miracle on Ice Team, and Jesse Ventura, former Independent Governor of Minnesota and Pro Wrestler.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]][[Geographic references#2|&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;]] of [[2000]], there are 1,033 people, 353 households, and 304 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 144.5/km&amp;sup2; (374.5/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 374 housing units at an average density of 52.3/km&amp;sup2; (135.6/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 98.26% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.48% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.10% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.77% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.29% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.10% from two or more races.  0.87% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 353 households out of which 42.8% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 80.7% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 3.4% have a female householder with no husband present, and 13.6% are non-families. 10.8% of all households are made up of individuals and 3.7% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.93 and the average family size is 3.16.

In the city the population is spread out with 29.7% under the age of 18, 5.3% from 18 to 24, 18.6% from 25 to 44, 37.0% from 45 to 64, and 9.4% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 44 years.  For every 100 females there are 99.0 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 96.2 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $129,136, and the median income for a family is $133,717. Males have a median income of $84,792 versus $50,625 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $61,592.  1.9% of the population and 1.6% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 3.3% of those under the age of 18 and 1.4% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

[[Category:Cities in Minnesota]]
[[Category:Washington County, Minnesota]]

[[io:Dellwood, Minnesota]]</text>
