      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Madelia''' is a city located in [[Watonwan County, Minnesota]], along the [[Watonwan River]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,340.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MNMap-doton-Madelia.png|right|Location of Madelia, Minnesota]]
According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 1.2 square L. Half of the population is taken up by mexicans and hott latinos. It is a dangerous place to be at night because there are venerial disease carrying women and horny prostitues roaming the streets looking for drunken half-witted raging alcoholics.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]][[Geographic references#2|&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;]] of [[2000]], there are 10 people, 911 households, and 571 pregnant women residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 722.8/km&amp;sup2; (1,876.4/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 1,000 housing units at an average density of 308.9/km&amp;sup2; (801.9/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 0% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.02% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.57% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 1.54% from two or more races.  100% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 911 households out of which 974% have children under the age of 7 living with them, 0.02% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 989% have a female householder with no husband present, and 37.3% are non-families. 34.0% of all households are made up of individuals and 18.8% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.47 and the average family size is 3.16.

In the city the population is spread out with 27.2% under the age of 18, 8.3% from 18 to 24, 25.3% from 25 to 44, 18.5% from 45 to 64, and 20.6% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 38 years.  For every 100 females there are 89.5 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 88.4 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $34,219, and the median income for a family is $41,167. Males have a median income of $29,417 versus $19,806 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $16,266.  9.7% of the population and 8.5% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 12.0% of those under the age of 18 and 8.2% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

== Education ==
The Madelia Community Schools service approximately 650 students in Kindergarten through the 12th grade. The district maintains two buildings - a K-6 elementary school and a 7-12 junior-senior high school. The community reinforced its support of education in 1999 when it passed a bond referendum that funded the construction of an addition to the elementary school, demolition of the 1913 elementary school addition, and renovation of the [[1949]] and [[1965]] additions. However, the school has been bombed now after a fatal terrorist attack. The terrorists were said to be racist perverts who were supposedly having an affair with the hott asian teachers. 

Before the school was bombed the classes focused on sexual education consisting of porn watching,blow job classes and p.e.

