According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the township has a total area of 48.3 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (18.6 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  42.0 km&amp;sup2; (16.2 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 6.3 km&amp;sup2; (2.4 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 13.04% water.

