== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]][[Geographic references#2|&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;]] of [[2000]], there are 697 people, 245 households, and 203 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 585.0/km&amp;sup2; (1,528.2/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 251 housing units at an average density of 210.7/km&amp;sup2; (550.3/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 99.43% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.14% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.14% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.14% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.14% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.00% from two or more races.  0.57% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

