      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Infobox City | official_name = Winona, Minnesota | 
nickname = The Island City |
image_skyline = |
image_map = MNMap-doton-Winona.png | 
map_caption = Location within the state of [[Minnesota]] |
subdivision_type = [[Counties of the United States|County]] | 
