      </contributor>
      <comment>+[[newbury Street (Boston)]]</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Newbury''' may be:

* Several places in the [[United Kingdom]]:
** [[Newbury, Berkshire|Newbury]], [[Berkshire]] (where the names of many others are derived.)
*** The [[Newbury (UK Parliament constituency)|Newbury]] constituency of the [[British House of Commons]]
** [[Newbury Park, London|Newbury Park]], [[London]]

* Several places in [[Canada]]
** [[Newbury, Ontario]], a village in [[Ontario]]
** [[Newbury Station, Ontario]], in [[Southwest Middlesex, Ontario|Southwest Middlesex]] township, [[Middlesex County, Ontario|Middlesex County]], [[Ontario]]

* Several places in [[United States|United States of America]]
** [[Newbury, Massachusetts|Newbury]], [[Massachusetts]]
***[[Newbury Street (Boston)|Newbury Street]] in [[Boston]]
** [[Newbury, New Hampshire|Newbury]], [[New Hampshire]]
** [[Newbury, Ohio|Newbury]], [[Ohio]]
** [[Newbury Park, California|Newbury Park]], [[California]]
** [[Newburyport, Massachusetts|Newburyport]], [[Massachusetts]]
** [[West Newbury, Massachusetts|West Newbury]], [[Massachusetts]]

* A place in [[Australia]]
** [[Newbury, New South Wales|Newbury]], [[New South Wales]]

* In addition, there are places named [[Newberry]].

{{disambig}}</text>
    </revision>
  </page>
