      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Clarkfield''' is a city located in [[Yellow Medicine County, Minnesota]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 944.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MNMap-doton-Clarkfield.png|right|Location of Clarkfield, Minnesota]]
According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 2.8 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (1.1 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  2.8 km&amp;sup2; (1.1 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

http://www.clarkfieldminnesota.com

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]][[Geographic references#2|&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;]] of [[2000]], there are 944 people, 371 households, and 228 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 337.5/km&amp;sup2; (872.7/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 429 housing units at an average density of 153.4/km&amp;sup2; (396.6/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 98.52% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.11% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.21% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.11% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.42% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.64% from two or more races.  1.17% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 371 households out of which 26.1% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 50.9% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 8.4% have a female householder with no husband present, and 38.5% are non-families. 35.3% of all households are made up of individuals and 22.1% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.25 and the average family size is 2.92.

In the city the population is spread out with 21.7% under the age of 18, 7.1% from 18 to 24, 20.9% from 25 to 44, 19.0% from 45 to 64, and 31.4% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 45 years.  For every 100 females there are 89.2 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 84.3 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $33,819, and the median income for a family is $39,926. Males have a median income of $28,900 versus $17,431 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $17,349.  12.8% of the population and 10.1% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 17.2% of those under the age of 18 and 14.4% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

==Geography==
Located on a georgeous lake shore at the foot of the rocky mountains, Clarkfield is a popular tourist destination.  Tempatures are warm and moderate year round with an average tempature of 68F.  Although Clarkfield is a beautiful, majestic city, it is plagued by high hydrogen monoxide content in its drinking water.

[[Category:Cities in Minnesota]]
