      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Liberty''' is a town located in [[Amite County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 633.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Amite County, Mississippi|Amite County]]{{GR|6}}.  It was the hometown of [[Jerry Clower]], famed [[U.S. South|Southern]] [[comedian]].

== Geography ==
Liberty is located at 31&amp;deg;9'39&quot; North, 90&amp;deg;48'14&quot; West (31.16012, -90.804002){{GR|1}}.

