      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Ashland''' is a town located in [[Benton County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 577.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Benton County, Mississippi|Benton County]]{{GR|6}}.

== Geography ==
Ashland is located at 34&amp;deg;49'57&quot; North, 89&amp;deg;10'45&quot; West (34.832368, -89.179094){{GR|1}}.

