      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Calhoun City''' is a town located in [[Calhoun County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 1,872.

== Geography ==
Calhoun City is located at 33&amp;deg;51'25&quot; North, 89&amp;deg;18'48&quot; West (33.856865, -89.313342){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the town has a total area of 6.2 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (2.4 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  6.1 km&amp;sup2; (2.4 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.04 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 1.25% water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 1,872 people, 736 households, and 530 families residing in the town.  The [[population density]] is 305.0/km&amp;sup2; (789.1/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 827 housing units at an average density of 134.7/km&amp;sup2; (348.6/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the town is 66.72% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 32.00% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.11% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.05% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.16% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.96% from two or more races.  0.69% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 736 households out of which 34.5% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 44.3% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 23.6% have a female householder with no husband present, and 27.9% are non-families. 26.4% of all households are made up of individuals and 15.6% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.38 and the average family size is 2.84.

In the town the population is spread out with 25.1% under the age of 18, 8.1% from 18 to 24, 23.2% from 25 to 44, 21.6% from 45 to 64, and 22.0% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 39 years.  For every 100 females there are 73.0 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 66.4 males.

The median income for a household in the town is $23,983, and the median income for a family is $28,047. Males have a median income of $27,917 versus $20,292 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the town is $14,294.  25.2% of the population and 23.2% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 41.1% of those under the age of 18 and 16.9% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

