      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Georgetown''' is a town located in [[Copiah County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 344.

== Geography ==
Georgetown is located at 31&amp;deg;52'16&quot; North, 90&amp;deg;9'51&quot; West (31.871058, -90.164186){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the town has a total area of 1.8 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (0.7 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  1.7 km&amp;sup2; (0.7 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 1.47% is water.

