In the town the population is spread out with 29.9% under the age of 18, 8.1% from 18 to 24, 29.7% from 25 to 44, 20.9% from 45 to 64, and 11.3% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 35 years.  For every 100 females there are 90.1 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 81.2 males.

The median income for a household in the town is $25,781, and the median income for a family is $31,000. Males have a median income of $28,958 versus $20,313 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the town is $17,919.  22.4% of the population and 19.3% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 26.0% of those under the age of 18 and 31.8% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

