      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Collins''' is a city located in [[Covington County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,683.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Covington County, Mississippi|Covington County]]{{GR|6}}.

== Geography ==
