According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 19.7 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (7.6 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  19.7 km&amp;sup2; (7.6 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.04 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 0.39% water.

