* [http://www.olivebrancholdtowne.com/ Olive Branch Old Towne]
* [http://www.fbcob.org/ First Baptist Church of Olive Branch]
* [http://www.olivebrancholdtowne.com/wesson/wesson.html Wesson House]
{{Mapit-US-cityscale|34.963007|-89.841627}}

