      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Petal''' is a city located in [[Forrest County, Mississippi]], along the [[Leaf River (Mississippi)|Leaf River]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 7,579.

== Geography ==
Petal is located at 31&amp;deg;20'48&quot; North, 89&amp;deg;15'20&quot; West (31.346740, -89.255485){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 25.1 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (9.7 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  25.0 km&amp;sup2; (9.7 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.04 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 0.21% water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 7,579 people, 2,979 households, and 2,079 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 302.6/km&amp;sup2; (783.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 3,208 housing units at an average density of 128.1/km&amp;sup2; (331.7/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 93.93% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 4.43% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.29% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.08% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.53% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.74% from two or more races.  1.44% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 2,979 households out of which 34.9% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 50.4% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 15.2% have a female householder with no husband present, and 30.2% are non-families. 26.6% of all households are made up of individuals and 13.0% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.52 and the average family size is 3.05.

In the city the population is spread out with 27.2% under the age of 18, 9.8% from 18 to 24, 28.9% from 25 to 44, 19.6% from 45 to 64, and 14.6% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 34 years.  For every 100 females there are 87.9 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 82.9 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $29,637, and the median income for a family is $35,343. Males have a median income of $27,500 versus $20,741 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $13,996.  15.0% of the population and 11.9% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 19.4% of those under the age of 18 and 13.8% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

