      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Leakesville''' is a town located in [[Greene County, Mississippi]], along the [[Chickasawhay River]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 1,026.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Greene County, Mississippi|Greene County]]{{GR|6}}.

