In the town the population is spread out with 35.8% under the age of 18, 8.0% from 18 to 24, 28.2% from 25 to 44, 18.4% from 45 to 64, and 9.6% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 30 years.  For every 100 females there are 84.4 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 76.7 males.

The median income for a household in the town is $20,000, and the median income for a family is $27,981. Males have a median income of $29,375 versus $14,375 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the town is $10,272.  31.2% of the population and 26.4% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 40.2% of those under the age of 18 and 28.6% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

