      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Grenada''' is a city located in [[Grenada County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 14,879.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Grenada County, Mississippi|Grenada County]]{{GR|6}}.

