* [[Nevada Barr]] 
* [[Lance Bass]]
* [[Jeff Brantley]]
* [[George Dale]]
* [[Ted DiBiase]]
* [[Meredith Edwards]]
* [[Bernard Ebbers]] - [[Worldcom]] CEO
* [[Shelly Fairchild]]
* [[Marty Frankel]]
* [[Barry Hannah]]
* [[Matthew &quot;Thew&quot; Ingram]]

