As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 2,932 people, 1,075 households, and 744 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 507.6/km&amp;sup2; (1,316.4/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 1,209 housing units at an average density of 209.3/km&amp;sup2; (542.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 28.79% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 70.16% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.14% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.31% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.07% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.55% from two or more races.  0.78% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

