      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Lexington''' is a city located in [[Holmes County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,025.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Holmes County, Mississippi|Holmes County]]{{GR|6}}.

