As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 2,025 people, 725 households, and 503 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 319.1/km&amp;sup2; (825.6/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 802 housing units at an average density of 126.4/km&amp;sup2; (327.0/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 31.36% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 67.26% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.05% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.64% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.00% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.69% from two or more races.  1.98% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

