The median income for a household in the town is $28,750, and the median income for a family is $31,875. Males have a median income of $25,625 versus $22,500 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the town is $14,658.  13.2% of the population and 14.0% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 15.9% of those under the age of 18 and 40.4% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

