*[http://www.spiritualtravel.org/OBE/nde_arguments.html Short Article Describing Some of the Weaknesses of the Scientific Explanations for Near-death Experience and Out-of-body Experience]
* [http://www.ceaec.org/ Brazilian Research and Education Campus centered on Psychic Development and Out-of-body experiences]
