      <text xml:space="preserve">'''De Kalb''' is a town located in [[Kemper County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 972.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Kemper County, Mississippi|Kemper County]]{{GR|6}}.

