      <comment>Add USA - why do some people think only Americans read this?</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Monticello''' is a town located in [[Lawrence County, Mississippi]], [[USA]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 1,726.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Lawrence County, Mississippi|Lawrence County]]{{GR|6}}.

== Geography ==
Monticello is located at 31&amp;deg;33'15&quot; North, 90&amp;deg;6'36&quot; West (31.554181, -90.109962){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the town has a total area of 8.7 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (3.3 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  8.4 km&amp;sup2; (3.2 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.2 km&amp;sup2; (0.1 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 2.69% water.

== Demographics ==
