      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Hatley''' is a town located in [[Monroe County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 476.

== Geography ==
Hatley is located at 33&amp;deg;58'47&quot; North, 88&amp;deg;25'34&quot; West (33.979688, -88.426244){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the town has a total area of 3.5 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (1.3 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  3.5 km&amp;sup2; (1.3 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
