      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Stafford''' is the name of several places in the world:
* [[Stafford]], [[England]], [[United Kingdom|UK]], the county town of [[Staffordshire]]
* [[Stafford, New York]],  [[United States|United States of America]]
* [[Stafford, Queensland]], a suburb of [[Brisbane]], [[Australia]]
* [[Stafford, Texas]], United States of America
* [[Stafford, Virginia]], United States of America
* [[Stafford County, Virginia]], United States of America
* [[Stafford, South Africa]], [[South Africa]]
* [[Stafford, Connecticut]], United States of America

(Note that these places should not be confused with places named [[Strafford]] or [[Stratford]].)

'''Stafford''' is also the name of some people:
*[[Jo Stafford]], [[United States|American]] [[popular music|popular]] [[singer]]
*[[Stafford Cripps]], British politician 1889 &amp;ndash; 1952
