      <text xml:space="preserve">'''New Augusta''' is a town located in [[Perry County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 715.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Perry County, Mississippi|Perry County]]{{GR|6}}.

