      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Pontotoc''' is a city located in [[Pontotoc County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 5,253.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Pontotoc County, Mississippi|Pontotoc County]]{{GR|6}}.

