      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Morton''' is a city located in [[Scott County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 3,482.

== Geography ==
Morton is located at 32&amp;deg;20'57&quot; North, 89&amp;deg;39'16&quot; West (32.349056, -89.654366){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 17.5 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (6.8 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  17.4 km&amp;sup2; (6.7 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.04 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 0.59% water.

