      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Raleigh''' is a town located in [[Smith County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 1,255.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Smith County, Mississippi|Smith County]]{{GR|6}}.

