      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Wiggins''' is a city located in [[Stone County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 3,849.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Stone County, Mississippi|Stone County]]{{GR|6}}.

