      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Moorhead''' is a city located in [[Sunflower County, Mississippi|Sunflower County]], [[Mississippi]]. As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,573. The town includes the legendary [[blues (music)|blues]] [[crossroads]] &quot;[[where the Southern cross the Dog]]&quot;.

== Geography ==
Moorhead is located at 33&amp;deg;26'57&quot; North, 90&amp;deg;30'17&quot; West (33.449119, -90.504827){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 3.4 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (1.3 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  3.3 km&amp;sup2; (1.3 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.77% is water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 210,573 people, 688 households, and 520 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 770.1/km&amp;sup2; (1,988.9/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 720 housing units at an average density of 215.5/km&amp;sup2; (556.6/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 20.44% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 78.97% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.00% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.19% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.27% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.12% from two or more races.  1.24% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 8,391 households out of which 37.6% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 34.7% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 34.7% have a female householder with no husband present, and 24.3% are non-families. 20.3% of all households are made up of individuals and 9.0% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 3.14 and the average family size is 3.67.

In the city the population is spread out with 28.1% under the age of 18, 26.7% from 18 to 24, 21.3% from 25 to 44, 16.3% from 45 to 64, and 7.7% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 22 years.  For every 100 females there are 88.8 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 82.8 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $20,401, and the median income for a family is $23,000. Males have a median income of $26,538 versus $17,697 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $8,631.  38.0% of the population and 32.4% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 46.3% of those under the age of 18 and 33.5% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

