There are 319 households out of which 30.4% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 45.1% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 14.4% have a female householder with no husband present, and 36.4% are non-families. 35.1% of all households are made up of individuals and 19.4% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.36 and the average family size is 3.06.

In the town the population is spread out with 26.9% under the age of 18, 10.6% from 18 to 24, 25.7% from 25 to 44, 19.5% from 45 to 64, and 17.2% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 36 years.  For every 100 females there are 81.7 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 78.9 males.

The median income for a household in the town is $17,102, and the median income for a family is $23,906. Males have a median income of $29,444 versus $17,292 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the town is $10,212.  26.4% of the population and 25.1% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 25.4% of those under the age of 18 and 40.8% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

