      <text xml:space="preserve">'''New Albany''' is a city located in [[Union County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 7,607.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Union County, Mississippi|Union County]]{{GR|6}}.

