      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Arcola''' is a town located in [[Washington County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 563.

== Geography ==
Arcola is located at 33&amp;deg;16'12&quot; North, 90&amp;deg;52'49&quot; West (33.270106, -90.880297){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the town has a total area of 0.6 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (0.2 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  0.6 km&amp;sup2; (0.2 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 563 people, 183 households, and 122 families residing in the town.  The [[population density]] is 988.1/km&amp;sup2; (2,515.2/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 220 housing units at an average density of 386.1/km&amp;sup2; (982.9/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the town is 4.80% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 95.03% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.00% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.00% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.00% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.18% from two or more races.  0.18% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 183 households out of which 36.6% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 23.0% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 36.1% have a female householder with no husband present, and 33.3% are non-families. 27.9% of all households are made up of individuals and 13.7% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 3.08 and the average family size is 3.83.

In the town the population is spread out with 36.6% under the age of 18, 10.3% from 18 to 24, 25.8% from 25 to 44, 18.5% from 45 to 64, and 8.9% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 28 years.  For every 100 females there are 77.6 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 71.6 males.

The median income for a household in the town is $18,409, and the median income for a family is $18,594. Males have a median income of $22,321 versus $13,466 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the town is $6,827.  49.7% of the population and 43.4% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 63.2% of those under the age of 18 and 53.2% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

