      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Hollandale''' is a city located in [[Washington County, Mississippi]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 3,437.

== Geography ==
Hollandale is located at 33&amp;deg;10'24&quot; North, 90&amp;deg;51'19&quot; West (33.173467, -90.855247){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 5.8 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (2.2 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  5.8 km&amp;sup2; (2.2 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 3,437 people, 1,104 households, and 803 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 592.4/km&amp;sup2; (1,536.3/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 1,156 housing units at an average density of 199.3/km&amp;sup2; (516.7/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 16.06% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 83.21% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.00% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.09% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.00% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.64% from two or more races.  0.76% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 1,104 households out of which 37.1% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 34.9% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 32.6% have a female householder with no husband present, and 27.2% are non-families. 24.7% of all households are made up of individuals and 13.0% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 3.10 and the average family size is 3.72.

In the city the population is spread out with 35.4% under the age of 18, 10.8% from 18 to 24, 24.9% from 25 to 44, 18.0% from 45 to 64, and 11.0% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 28 years.  For every 100 females there are 80.5 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 69.9 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $20,135, and the median income for a family is $25,313. Males have a median income of $23,194 versus $17,353 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $9,251.  38.6% of the population and 28.4% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 52.7% of those under the age of 18 and 24.9% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

