The Kirksville-Ottumwa DMA includes a FOX affiliate, KYOU-TV 15, and is covered by NBC and CBS from [[Hannibal, Missouri|Hannibal]]-[[Quincy, Illinois|Quincy]] and, in some areas, Kansas City.  Radios in Kirksville can also pick up stations from [[Brookfield, Missouri|Brookfield]], [[Macon, Missouri|Macon]], [[Moberly, Missouri|Moberly]], Hannibal-Quincy, and [[Keokuk, Iowa]].

In print, Kirksville is served by the ''Daily Express''[http://www.kirksvilledailyexpress.com/] six days a week and on Thursdays by the ''Index''[http://www.trumanindex.com/home/], the weekly newspaper produced by students at Truman.

== Major Employers ==
* [[Truman State University]]
* Northeast Regional Health System [http://www.hospital-data.com/hospitals/NORTHEAST-REGIONAL-HEALTH-SYSTEMS-KI497.html]
