* Wal-Mart Supercenter Store #189 
* Adair Foods (Kraft Foods) [http://www.kraftoperations.com/Facility.asp?FacilityID=102]
* Kirksville R-III Public School District [http://www.kirksville.k12.mo.us/]
* Preferred Family Health Care 
* Hollister, Inc [http://www.hollister.com/us/about/corporate.html]
* Sodexho [http://www.sodexhousa.com/edu_cam_index.asp]
* Hy-Vee Food and Drug Store #79 [http://www.hy-vee.com/storefinder/storefinder_detail.asp?store=79]
* Twin Pines Adult Care Center
* Ortech Company
* City of Kirksville municipal government
* Northeast Missouri Health Council, Inc [http://www.nmhcinc.org/]
* Kirksville Manor Care Center [http://www.hospital-data.com/hospitals/KIRKSVILLE-MANOR-CARE-CENTER-KIRKSVI821.html]
* Wire Rope of America [http://www.wrca.com/support_about.html]

