      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Novinger''' is a city located in [[Adair County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 534.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MOMap-doton-Novinger.png|right|Location of Novinger, Missouri]]

Novinger is located at 40&amp;deg;13'60&quot; North, 92&amp;deg;42'23&quot; West (40.233198, -92.706504){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 2.1 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (0.8 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  2.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.8 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.04 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 2.44% water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 534 people, 225 households, and 152 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 254.5/km&amp;sup2; (662.7/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 246 housing units at an average density of 117.3/km&amp;sup2; (305.3/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 99.25% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.00% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.75% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.00% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.00% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.00% from two or more races.  1.50% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 225 households out of which 33.3% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 51.1% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 12.0% have a female householder with no husband present, and 32.4% are non-families. 29.8% of all households are made up of individuals and 15.1% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.37 and the average family size is 2.95.

In the city the population is spread out with 25.1% under the age of 18, 10.9% from 18 to 24, 24.3% from 25 to 44, 25.1% from 45 to 64, and 14.6% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 37 years.  For every 100 females there are 103.0 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 93.2 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $20,990, and the median income for a family is $26,000. Males have a median income of $19,500 versus $17,625 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $10,586.  15.6% of the population and 14.9% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 19.7% of those under the age of 18 and 15.8% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

== External links ==
