According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 0.7 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (0.3 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  0.7 km&amp;sup2; (0.3 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

