      <text xml:space="preserve">For the [[Chicago Cubs]] [[pitcher]], see [[Rich Hill (baseball player)]].

'''Rich Hill''' is a city located in [[Bates County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,461.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MOMap-doton-Rich_Hill.png|right|Location of Rich Hill, Missouri]]

Rich Hill is located at 38&amp;deg;5'45&quot; North, 94&amp;deg;21'48&quot; West (38.095781, -94.363214){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 3.5 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (1.4 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  3.5 km&amp;sup2; (1.4 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 1,461 people, 617 households, and 391 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 411.7/km&amp;sup2; (1,064.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 727 housing units at an average density of 204.9/km&amp;sup2; (529.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 97.33% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.14% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 1.37% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.14% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.21% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.82% from two or more races.  0.82% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 617 households out of which 30.5% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 48.9% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 11.7% have a female householder with no husband present, and 36.5% are non-families. 32.4% of all households are made up of individuals and 20.7% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.37 and the average family size is 3.00.

In the city the population is spread out with 27.0% under the age of 18, 8.8% from 18 to 24, 24.4% from 25 to 44, 22.4% from 45 to 64, and 17.5% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 37 years.  For every 100 females there are 85.9 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 80.2 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $22,964, and the median income for a family is $28,938. Males have a median income of $25,476 versus $15,978 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $15,356.  19.0% of the population and 16.0% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 25.5% of those under the age of 18 and 18.7% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

