      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Marble Hill''' is a city located in [[Bollinger County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,502.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Bollinger County, Missouri|Bollinger County]]{{GR|6}}. Marble Hill is the most populous city in Bollinger County with the rest of the towns in this county appearing to have populations of less than 150.

