      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Camdenton''' is a city located in [[Camden County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,779.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Camden County, Missouri|Camden County]]{{GR|6}}.

