According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 1.1 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (0.4 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  1.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.4 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 363 people, 162 households, and 99 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 318.5/km&amp;sup2; (830.7/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 184 housing units at an average density of 161.5/km&amp;sup2; (421.1/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 98.07% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.00% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.55% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.00% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.00% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 1.38% from two or more races.  0.28% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 162 households out of which 25.3% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 47.5% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 10.5% have a female householder with no husband present, and 38.3% are non-families. 36.4% of all households are made up of individuals and 25.3% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.20 and the average family size is 2.85.

In the city the population is spread out with 22.6% under the age of 18, 9.1% from 18 to 24, 21.2% from 25 to 44, 20.4% from 45 to 64, and 26.7% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 43 years.  For every 100 females there are 78.8 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 75.6 males.

