      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Van Buren''' is a town located in [[Carter County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 845.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Carter County, Missouri|Carter County]]{{GR|6}}.

