      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Strasburg''' is a city located in [[Cass County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 136.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MOMap-doton-Strasburg.png|right|Location of Strasburg, Missouri]]

