      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Ozark''' is a city located in [[Christian County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 9,665.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Christian County, Missouri|Christian County]]{{GR|6}}.

