      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Claycomo''' is a village located in [[Clay County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the village had a total population of 1,267.  [[Ford Motor Company]] has a plant here, assembling the [[Ford F-Series]] trucks and [[Ford Escape]]/[[Mazda Tribute]] SUVs.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MOMap-doton-Claycomo.png|right|Location of Claycomo, Missouri]]

Claycomo is located at 39&amp;deg;12'2&quot; North, 94&amp;deg;29'22&quot; West (39.200507, -94.489404){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the village has a total area of 6.5 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (2.5 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  6.5 km&amp;sup2; (2.5 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 1,267 people, 596 households, and 345 families residing in the village.  The [[population density]] is 195.7/km&amp;sup2; (506.0/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 626 housing units at an average density of 96.7/km&amp;sup2; (250.0/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the village is 94.55% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 2.29% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.39% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.71% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.39% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 1.66% from two or more races.  2.37% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 596 households out of which 22.1% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 41.9% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 11.9% have a female householder with no husband present, and 42.1% are non-families. 36.1% of all households are made up of individuals and 10.6% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.10 and the average family size is 2.72.

In the village the population is spread out with 19.7% under the age of 18, 9.2% from 18 to 24, 27.9% from 25 to 44, 26.5% from 45 to 64, and 16.7% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 40 years.  For every 100 females there are 96.7 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 95.4 males.

The median income for a household in the village is $39,271, and the median income for a family is $44,861. Males have a median income of $29,531 versus $23,990 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the village is $20,000.  4.7% of the population and 4.3% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 10.6% of those under the age of 18 and 5.7% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

