      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Prathersville''' is a village located in [[Clay County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the village had a total population of 111.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MOMap-doton-Prathersville.png|right|Location of Prathersville, Missouri]]

