      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Greenfield''' is a city in [[Dade County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,358.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Dade County, Missouri|Dade County]]{{GR|6}}.

