As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 1,358 people, 623 households, and 368 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 476.7/km&amp;sup2; (1,235.0/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 731 housing units at an average density of 256.6/km&amp;sup2; (664.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 95.88% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.37% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 1.10% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.07% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.07% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.37% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 2.14% from two or more races.  1.18% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

