      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Owensville''' is a city located in [[Gasconade County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,500.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MOMap-doton-Owensville.png|right|Location of Owensville, Missouri]]

Owensville is located at 38&amp;deg;20'48&quot; North, 91&amp;deg;29'60&quot; West (38.346591, -91.499878){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 5.2 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (2.0 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  5.2 km&amp;sup2; (2.0 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
