      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Fair Grove''' is a city located in [[Greene County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,107.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MOMap-doton-Fair_Grove.png|right|Location of Fair Grove, Missouri]]

