      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Trenton''' is a city located in [[Grundy County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 6,216.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Grundy County, Missouri|Grundy County]]{{GR|6}}.

== Geography ==
