As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 141 people, 56 households, and 38 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 217.8/km&amp;sup2; (569.7/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 69 housing units at an average density of 106.6/km&amp;sup2; (278.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 95.74% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.71% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 1.42% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.00% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 2.13% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.00% from two or more races.  3.55% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

