      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Clinton''' is a city located in [[Henry County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 9,311.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Henry County, Missouri|Henry County]]{{GR|6}}.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MOMap-doton-Clinton.png|right|Location of Clinton, Missouri]]

Clinton is located at 38&amp;deg;22'12&quot; North, 93&amp;deg;46'18&quot; West (38.370067, -93.771689){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 24.0 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (9.3 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  23.9 km&amp;sup2; (9.2 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.04 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 0.22% water.

As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 9,311 people, 3,978 households, and 2,502 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 389.1/km&amp;sup2; (1,007.6/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 4,342 housing units at an average density of 181.4/km&amp;sup2; (469.9/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 95.49% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 1.77% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.92% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.31% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.50% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 1.00% from two or more races.  1.03% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 3,978 households out of which 27.8% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 47.0% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 12.1% have a female householder with no husband present, and 37.1% are non-families. 33.1% of all households are made up of individuals and 16.3% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.26 and the average family size is 2.84.

In the city the population is spread out with 23.4% under the age of 18, 8.8% from 18 to 24, 25.6% from 25 to 44, 21.2% from 45 to 64, and 20.9% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 39 years.  For every 100 females there are 88.4 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 82.7 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $28,079, and the median income for a family is $32,378. Males have a median income of $26,834 versus $19,096 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $16,282.  15.5% of the population and 11.9% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 21.0% of those under the age of 18 and 13.3% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

== Recreation ==

Clinton lies at the western end of the [[Katy Trail State Park|Katy Trail]], a 225 mile long state park enjoyed by cyclists, runners, and horseback riders.

== External links ==

* [http://www.bikekatytrail.com/ Katy Trail Information]

* [http://clintonmo.com/ Clinton Missouri Website]

