In the village the population is spread out with 18.9% under the age of 18, 3.9% from 18 to 24, 15.0% from 25 to 44, 39.4% from 45 to 64, and 22.8% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 53 years.  For every 100 females there are 95.4 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 102.0 males.

The median income for a household in the village is $29,583, and the median income for a family is $40,417. Males have a median income of $31,806 versus $21,250 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the village is $27,243.  5.9% of the population and 4.7% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 0.0% of those under the age of 18 and 11.4% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

