      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Oregon''' is a city located in [[Holt County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 935.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Holt County, Missouri|Holt County]]{{GR|6}}.

