According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 6.8 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (2.6 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  6.8 km&amp;sup2; (2.6 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

