      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Arnold''' is a city located in [[Jefferson County, Missouri]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 19,965.

== Geography ==
[[Image:MOMap-doton-Arnold.png|right|Location of Arnold, Missouri]]

