As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 9,048 people, 3,463 households, and 2,489 families residing in the CDP.  The [[population density]] is 880.0/km&amp;sup2; (2,281.9/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 3,613 housing units at an average density of 351.4/km&amp;sup2; (911.2/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the CDP is 97.75% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.22% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.20% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.43% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.33% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 1.07% from two or more races.  1.07% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

