As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 669 people, 217 households, and 182 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 461.3/km&amp;sup2; (1,190.1/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 232 housing units at an average density of 160.0/km&amp;sup2; (412.7/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 97.61% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.00% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.30% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 1.49% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.00% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.60% from two or more races.  0.60% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

